#: lib/phoenix_kit_web/live/settings/users.html.heex:416
msgid "A user holding two or more switchable roles works as one of them and gets only that role's access: an Admin acting as another role has no admin access until they switch back. Owner and Admin are always switchable; the User role always applies. The choice is per session — each sign-in starts in the first role the user holds, in the order set on the Roles page."
